The drop chance of the revenant spirit scales with two values: the combat level of the revenant being killed, and the number of pets already owned. It is calculated as such:
\begin{align}
base & = (\text{number of pets} + 1) \times 250 \\
chance & = \frac{1}{\left \lfloor base \times \frac{150}{\text{revenant combat level}} \right \rfloor}
\end{align}
There are four revenant goblins, each with a separate combat level, which are all considered individually (i.e. there is not a single value for goblin - each of the four versions uses their own combat level in the calculation).
The following calculator can be used to calculate individual chances, or use the 'All' revenant to show all for that pet number - combined with 'show all' to see all of the chances.
